      "help_en": "Filters query results by connection type. Valid values: Http, MySQL, PostgreSQL, Elasticsearch, OSS_TABLES, SLS, OTS, MaxCompute, MongoDB, Redis, SQLServer, ClickHouse, Oracle, Hive, Iceberg, lakehouse. If this parameter is not specified, all types are returned",
