      "help_en": "Excludes a single connection type. Valid values are the same as those for Type. Specify a single type name. Arrays or comma-separated values are not supported. For example, specify Http to exclude HTTP connections. If this parameter is not specified or is set to an empty string, no types are excluded. If this parameter is set to the same value as Type, an empty list is returned. Pagination and total count are calculated after filtering",
